// Embeds the Cindro arc-reactor icon into cindro-sidebar.exe. Windows uses
// the exe's first icon group for Explorer, the taskbar, the window class,
// and the Start-menu shortcut (the Inno [Icons] entry points IconFilename at
// this exe) — before this file existed the Windows app shipped iconless
// while Linux got packaging/cindro.svg via hicolor. jarvis.ico is regenerated
// from packaging/cindro.svg (rasterized 16..256px, packed multi-res) — the
// filename itself wasn't renamed since it's an internal build artifact, not
// user-facing.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "jarvis.ico"
